<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces have continued artillery attacks on Haftar positions while Haftar militia members surrendered at a strategic airbase, and Turkish officials publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, causing $31 million in losses, according to the National Oil Corporation. A suspected drone strike hit a Russian vessel near Benghazi and airstrikes destroyed ammunition depots at the Benghazi naval base, causing explosions. China is re-engaging in Libya with military forces linked to recent business deals. The United Nations introduced laws criminalising child conscription and raising the recruitment age to 18, and there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPWkFENWJtdjlNY1htMFRfSG5TcFAydFZDeHRMdU0wQUxOemx6em0yMzZ0ZURIbVBRdkZPMVlER01jaVhtRVpmVUFFX296ZDdHeHNjTWRPSzJHQm1jOGcybVZ6aGNnM1kwVWpQR3RTSHdYVk9NZTZmVVJVTFFQLU1wdkZNOFJDLXVPTE5pSjBQUFVvSkpJS0FWT3VLTExTa1V0SHlnQkdncTVoRXBTQ01WdEF5Q2N0WmtudEgxeg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNME16NzUyUE1JYWxSdVBMMkV0R0NaTk5lTWoxbHVQZmJlenRlUVF3Wms3T1BEZ3NFNkgyVVgyUVBBNTZ0eDJrY0JDLU5RV2ZJU2xXejNHOEJSOGozQmF3YnFLeUw1S2Z4OVFJV04ySTdHOGZ1QVR2SUdZTVhLdlZ2bFFsNDFsbGdEcFl3MGMzdGhhSjVtUVpuUHNVZEpvaXFjZ2E1aEQxcVNZb2ZwYklkcE4taGZqc2xQdjQtTw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Moscow Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9aRWQ0akc4bGxtZl9McEtSRWxPXzhLSkFEUHA5Zm00TGdpUEdYS2daMW9ES2RfSlV3WFFPMk5NcFE0Nk5wSnJqTEJfTXc3SVV4NTg0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPc054ZU9kaGtTRXByUXBMeVhiSnAwUk52QkNmdGJQLXZ2a2lTV1VvWWNhVFJ3TkVyVW9PaXVNZDA0SFlNNmE2NFhvSGlxVDQ5NUhJ